  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=gilmore item=0 page=script/quest/Q344_1000YearsTheEndOfLamentation/30754-12.htm
  S ActionFailed
  Q upsert Q344_1000YearsTheEndOfLamentation | <cond> | 2
  items 4269=0 4270=1
